{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celebrating the 20th anniversary of the Kiseki series, a story-driven RPG that began in 2004, the landmark first installment, The Legend of Heroes: Sora no Kiseki FC (First Chapter), is receiving a full remake!<br><br>The Liberl Kingdom, the setting of the adventure, is brought to life in stunning 3D, with refined designs for all characters, including the vibrant Estelle and Joshua.<br><br>Enjoy seamless transitions between two battle modes: field action and command battles. The remake also features dynamic presentations of each character's special abilities (Crafts) and elemental magic (Arts), delivering exhilarating and stress-free combat.<br>While retaining the picturesque charm of the Liberl Kingdom, the game offers various quests and extensive side content, allowing players to immerse themselves in the journey through the kingdom from a fresh perspective.<br><br>Estelle and Joshua embark on a journey across the Liberl Kingdom, spurred by the mysterious disappearance of their father, Cassius.<br><br>Meet new allies, experience heartfelt farewells, and uncover the fate that awaits the two at the end of their journey...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0A Classic Tale Told Through the Journey of Two Heroes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story follows Estelle, who dreams of becoming a &quot;Bracer&quot;\u2014a protector of regional peace\u2014and her brother Joshua.<br>As junior Bracers, the two set out on their first steps across the Kingdom of Liberl. Along their journey, they take on a variety of requests and solve incidents in the towns they visit, gaining valuable experience as Bracers.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447040/extras/ddddfb6f3ea2ed61a70041d5bedaa41e.poster.avif?t=1762838814\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447040/extras/ddddfb6f3ea2ed61a70041d5bedaa41e.webm?t=1762838814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0The World of Sora no Kiseki Brought to Life in Full 3D!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This full remake of The Legend of Heroes: Sora no Kiseki FC brings the Kingdom of Liberl to life in stunning 3D.<br>With seamless transitions from fields to towns, the game delivers an immersive experience, recreating the vibrant world of Sora no Kiseki like never before.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447040/extras/38611b76933707a133808371b83e22c1.poster.avif?t=1762838814\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447040/extras/38611b76933707a133808371b83e22c1.webm?t=1762838814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Systems &amp; Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between field action and command-based battles at any time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447040/extras/3e499c68f3c8ec46914986613f6573c4.poster.avif?t=1762838814\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447040/extras/3e499c68f3c8ec46914986613f6573c4.webm?t=1762838814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In command battles, fight strategically by following the turn order of both allies and enemies, making use of powerful attacks and magical abilities known as &quot;Arts.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With intuitive and easy-to-learn controls, even newcomers to RPGs can enjoy a smooth gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447040/extras/6224379ef8935bc0428fece3f1f6a7d5.poster.avif?t=1762838814\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447040/extras/6224379ef8935bc0428fece3f1f6a7d5.webm?t=1762838814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447040/extras/44c303b861710ce427dac8680b52339f.poster.avif?t=1762838814\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447040/extras/44c303b861710ce427dac8680b52339f.webm?t=1762838814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hero of Liberl","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3447040/8ddd1be8cfdb16f73f263d9467ac91f77f1e6fce.jpg"},{"name":"Junior Bracer Trainee","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3447040/3f852a93ec04ef013f17a5a51d710308a93be052.jpg"},{"name":"Expert Bracer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3447040/2cb8d8f00160d182c34fabfd4aa545697b8a9489.jpg"},{"name":"Promising Newcomer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3447040/4ec5031776d304dde00e3170d0d44f7b785621fd.jpg"},{"name":"Quest Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3447040/586ca48e9516aa5d54d64d038273bbc99596fa62.jpg"},{"name":"Battle Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3447040/a0317b73e57b7d8fdc9737e5ad84e27e6915e73e.jpg"},{"name":"Three-Star Chef","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3447040/aca14c49fe85eb17fee5807dbbc6c24fedf53787.jpg"},{"name":"Peculiar Chef","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3447040/2f0b825deae840f800a7c6eb792c499486f88a90.jpg"},{"name":"Book Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3447040/eca65938011673c8f256812b883ceee4bf37805b.jpg"},{"name":"Treasure Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3447040/14d41b17358d6f08be9d5c0db62f50d18d7cf69d.jpg"}],"total":43},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3447040?t=1762838814","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447040/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762838814","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447040/60b7a8172393c2acdcf18ae2e099425b640bfbb9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762838814","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447040/60b7a8172393c2acdcf18ae2e099425b640bfbb9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762838814","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3920660,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p>Digital Deluxe Edition includes:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447040/extras/a8beb4f141939abfca7b928d37b4d353.avif?t=1762838814\" width=1232 height=706 /></span><br>- Base game<br>- Sora no Kiseki the 1st Season Pass<br>DLC: Costumes/Attachment Items/Covers/Hair Colors (26 items total)<br>*The above describes the Digital Deluxe Edition. Standard Edition also available.<br><br>[Content to be released on Friday, 9/19]<br>Matching Diner Costume Set: Fine Red Diner Vol.1<br>Unique Diner Costume Set Vol.1<br>Glasses Set A<br>Head-Pom Set A<br>Archangel Costume Set<br>Lively Effect Set<br>Banner Set A<br>Two-Tone Hair Color Set<br>Orbment Cover Set<br><br>[Content to be released on Thursday, 9/25]<br>Jenis Royal Academy Uniform Set<br>Matching Diner Costume Set: Fine Red Diner Vol.2<br>Unique Diner Costume Set Vol.2<br>Glasses Set B<br>Head-Pom Set B<br>Pretty Backpack Set<br>Fallen Angel Costume Set<br>Banner Set B<br>Unique Hair Color Set<br>Chibi Character Cover Set<br><br>[Content to be released on Thursday, 10/2]<br>Estelle &amp; Joshua Swimwear: Pure Resort<br>Matching Diner Costume Set: Fine Red Diner Vol.3<br>Unique Diner Costume Set Vol.3<br>Go for it! Headgear Set<br>Chocosta Set<br>Demon King Costume Set<br>Banner Set C<br><br>*Season Pass does not include consumable items.<br>*Each item included in the Season Pass will also be available for individual purchase. Beware of duplicate purchases.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celebrating the 20th anniversary of the Kiseki series, a story-driven RPG that began in 2004, the landmark first installment, The Legend of Heroes: Sora no Kiseki FC (First Chapter), is receiving a full remake!<br><br>The Liberl Kingdom, the setting of the adventure, is brought to life in stunning 3D, with refined designs for all characters, including the vibrant Estelle and Joshua.<br><br>Enjoy seamless transitions between two battle modes: field action and command battles. The remake also features dynamic presentations of each character's special abilities (Crafts) and elemental magic (Arts), delivering exhilarating and stress-free combat.<br>While retaining the picturesque charm of the Liberl Kingdom, the game offers various quests and extensive side content, allowing players to immerse themselves in the journey through the kingdom from a fresh perspective.<br><br>Estelle and Joshua embark on a journey across the Liberl Kingdom, spurred by the mysterious disappearance of their father, Cassius.<br><br>Meet new allies, experience heartfelt farewells, and uncover the fate that awaits the two at the end of their journey...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0A Classic Tale Told Through the Journey of Two Heroes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story follows Estelle, who dreams of becoming a &quot;Bracer&quot;\u2014a protector of regional peace\u2014and her brother Joshua.<br>As junior Bracers, the two set out on their first steps across the Kingdom of Liberl. Along their journey, they take on a variety of requests and solve incidents in the towns they visit, gaining valuable experience as Bracers.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447040/extras/ddddfb6f3ea2ed61a70041d5bedaa41e.poster.avif?t=1762838814\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447040/extras/ddddfb6f3ea2ed61a70041d5bedaa41e.webm?t=1762838814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0The World of Sora no Kiseki Brought to Life in Full 3D!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This full remake of The Legend of Heroes: Sora no Kiseki FC brings the Kingdom of Liberl to life in stunning 3D.<br>With seamless transitions from fields to towns, the game delivers an immersive experience, recreating the vibrant world of Sora no Kiseki like never before.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447040/extras/38611b76933707a133808371b83e22c1.poster.avif?t=1762838814\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447040/extras/38611b76933707a133808371b83e22c1.webm?t=1762838814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Systems &amp; Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between field action and command-based battles at any time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447040/extras/3e499c68f3c8ec46914986613f6573c4.poster.avif?t=1762838814\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447040/extras/3e499c68f3c8ec46914986613f6573c4.webm?t=1762838814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In command battles, fight strategically by following the turn order of both allies and enemies, making use of powerful attacks and magical abilities known as &quot;Arts.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With intuitive and easy-to-learn controls, even newcomers to RPGs can enjoy a smooth gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447040/extras/6224379ef8935bc0428fece3f1f6a7d5.poster.avif?t=1762838814\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447040/extras/6224379ef8935bc0428fece3f1f6a7d5.webm?t=1762838814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447040/extras/44c303b861710ce427dac8680b52339f.poster.avif?t=176283